This repository (the Open Source Avatars registry: JSON data in data/, documentation in docs/, and integration reference code in integrations/) is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

You can copy, modify, distribute, and perform the work, even for commercial purposes, all without asking permission.

Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Individual avatars and collections have their own licenses; see data/projects.json for each collection’s license.
